===================================================
    
Case 1: multi-byte UTF-8 character inside a string literal (control)     

===================================================
'𡡡'    octet_length('𡡡')    
𡡡     4     

===================================================
    
Case 2: multi-byte UTF-8 character as an alias, outside any literal     

===================================================
t𡡡    
1     

===================================================
    
Case 3: multi-byte UTF-8 character followed by another byte in an alias     

===================================================
t𡡡x    
1     

